              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho arambarira, ati Subira ugende, ukunde wa mugore akundwa n’umwūzure wiwe, kandi w’umusambanyikazi, nk’uk’ Uhoraho nkunda Abisirayeli, naho bo bāhindukiriye izindi mana, bagakunda uturobe tubumbabumbge mu nzabibu zumye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
